 **Inputs:**
-*   `color`: The base surface color (RGB) at the hit point.
-*   `point`: The 3D coordinates of the surface hit point.
-*   `direction`: The incoming view direction vector (normalized).
-*   `scene`: The signed distance field (SDF) or scene representation.
-*   `light`: The light source definition (position, intensity).
-*   `reflection-count`: Integer, maximum number of bounces (default 3) [S2, unofficial].
